# ============================================================
#  SISTEMA SEMANA 11 — .gitignore
#  Backups, binarios y artefactos de build NO se versionan.
# ============================================================

# --- Backups / paquetes pesados (los dos .zip superan el límite de 100 MB de GitHub) ---
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.bak

# --- NuGet (restaurable con `nuget restore` o `dotnet restore`) ---
packages/
**/packages/
*.nupkg

# --- .NET / Visual Studio ---
.vs/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.dll.config.bak

# --- Sistema / editor ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
